# A parked car's hood edge grinds like a ledge: down onto it at 3 m/s, a 50-50 to the front end,
# off onto the road. (A parked car has no driver: no honk when you land in front of it.)
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -62.3 -322 2.31 0
cmd 1 car -51.1 -331.2 356 0
cmd 30 teleport -50.34 -330.18 3.34 355.2
cmd 30 set skater.vel.x -0.25
cmd 30 set skater.vel.y 2.99
tap grind 31
run 300
expect event grindStart{trick=FS 50-50,line=car hood} within 31..34
expect event grindEnd{reason=end} within 75..90
expect event comboLanded{name=FS 50-50} within 150..180
expect no event honk
expect no event bail
